# Keep local Flutter build artifacts out of the published archive.
#
# `dart pub publish` only reads ignore files at or below the package root, so the
# `build/` line in the repository-root .gitignore never reaches this package: git
# ignores the directory, pub packs it anyway. Without this file the archive ships
# the .dill compiler caches, which is tens of MB instead of well under one.
build/
